WEBVTT

00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:02.214
Cambridge English readers.

00:00:02.274 --> 00:00:04.005
Level one.

00:00:04.066 --> 00:00:12.144
Hotel Casanova by Sue Leather.

00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:25.249
Hotel Casanova by Sue Leather.

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:41.382
Chapter 1 Dino The 20th of April was Dino Bracco's 21st birthday.

00:00:41.442 --> 00:00:43.473
He worked.

00:00:43.532 --> 00:00:50.766
Giovanni, his boss at the Hotel Grand, brought him a cake from the hotel kitchen.

00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:58.626
Just 21, said Giovanni, and he put his hand on Dino's back.

00:00:58.686 --> 00:01:01.814
Ah, Dino, Dino.

00:01:01.874 --> 00:01:05.226
When I was 21.

00:01:05.286 --> 00:01:09.198
Dino ate some cake and smiled.

00:01:09.258 --> 00:01:15.481
He was only 21 years old, but he was a young man who knew what he wanted.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:18.182
He had a plan.

00:01:18.242 --> 00:01:22.224
You must know what you want, Dino.

00:01:22.284 --> 00:01:25.316
His mother said to him when he was a child.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.907
And he did.

00:01:26.967 --> 00:01:29.688
He had a plan.

00:01:29.748 --> 00:01:36.652
Dino came from a very small town called Rachella in the south of Italy.

00:01:36.712 --> 00:01:39.894
His mother and father were farmers.

00:01:39.954 --> 00:01:44.876
Rachella was beautiful, but no one had any money.

00:01:44.936 --> 00:01:50.110
Dino was born there, but now he lived and worked in Venice.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:54.793
He worked at the reception of the Hotel Grand.

00:01:54.853 --> 00:01:56.945
Wow!

00:01:57.005 --> 00:01:59.726
said Dino's friends in Rachella.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:03.760
You're at a big hotel on the Venice Lido.

00:02:03.819 --> 00:02:06.692
How did you get that job?

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:09.374
Dino smiled.

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:15.898
Because I work hard, he thought, and I have a plan.

00:02:15.957 --> 00:02:19.398
Dino liked his work at the reception.

00:02:19.457 --> 00:02:30.592
When guests came in, he said hello to them, and he asked, Sir, madam, would you like a glass of Soave, one of Venice's famous wines?

00:02:30.652 --> 00:02:33.114
He took their credit cards.

00:02:33.174 --> 00:02:37.356
When they weren't from Italy, he took their passports.

00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:41.820
Then he asked the boy to take their bags to their room.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.262
He helped the guests.

00:02:44.322 --> 00:02:47.492
Yes, madam, of course madam.

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:54.064
Dino's boss Giovanni Tardelli thought he was a good boy.

00:02:54.124 --> 00:02:59.248
He knew a girl at the hotel who also came from Rachella.

00:02:59.308 --> 00:03:04.050
Her name was Maria Luca and she worked as a waitress.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:10.414
Maria was nice and he liked to talk to her, but she was just a friend.

00:03:10.474 --> 00:03:16.370
On his birthday, she gave him a small picture of Rachella, their town.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:20.013
I did it," she smiled at him.

00:03:20.073 --> 00:03:24.214
You can look at the picture and think about home.

00:03:24.273 --> 00:03:26.764
Thank you, Maria.

00:03:26.824 --> 00:03:31.025
Dino smiled and put the picture in his little room.

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:36.096
The picture was nice, but he didn't think about Rachella much.

00:03:36.156 --> 00:03:39.617
He liked to think about his plans.

00:03:39.677 --> 00:03:42.479
Women liked Dino.

00:03:42.539 --> 00:03:44.351
Well, why not?

00:03:44.411 --> 00:03:50.635
He was good-looking, with dark, curly hair and beautiful brown eyes.

00:03:50.695 --> 00:03:52.806
And he was nice.

00:03:52.866 --> 00:03:56.799
The women who came to the hotel liked to talk to him.

00:03:56.859 --> 00:03:59.580
Dino was kind to them.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:05.438
But women were not in Dino's plans, not for the moment.

00:04:05.498 --> 00:04:14.437
When I'm 26, he thought, I'm going to meet a woman, the woman I want to marry.

00:04:14.497 --> 00:04:18.920
Dino knew that it was important to look good.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.742
It was his job.

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:28.208
He always wore good clothes, beautiful shirts, nice jackets and trousers.

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:34.632
His hair always looked good, and he was always elegante.

00:04:34.692 --> 00:04:40.446
He knew that Italy was famous for nice clothes and beautiful things.

00:04:40.506 --> 00:04:44.778
That's why people came to Italy, to Venice.

00:04:44.838 --> 00:04:50.140
Dino worked very long hours, and he didn't make much money.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:54.412
His room at the back of the hotel was very small.

00:04:54.472 --> 00:05:01.036
It just had a small bed, a table and a light, and somewhere for his clothes.

00:05:01.095 --> 00:05:07.170
But Dino didn't think about the long hours, the little money and the small room.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:13.136
He liked his job at the Hotel Grand, and it was only the start.

00:05:13.196 --> 00:05:15.549
He knew what he wanted.

00:05:15.608 --> 00:05:20.414
Every night he wrote about the day in his little black book.

00:05:20.474 --> 00:05:22.996
Then he looked at his plans.

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:26.652
He liked to read them every day.

00:05:26.712 --> 00:05:36.811
The night of the 20th of April, his 21st birthday, Dino sat in his little room and looked at his little black book.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:39.382
He looked at his plans.

00:05:39.442 --> 00:05:43.314
Everything is good, he thought.

00:05:43.374 --> 00:05:48.968
But on the 21st of April, something changed his plans.

00:05:49.028 --> 00:05:58.358
The woman with the long dark hair came and stayed at the Hotel Grand, and everything changed.

00:05:58.417 --> 00:06:05.666
Chapter 2, Dino in Love.

00:06:05.726 --> 00:06:08.538
Good morning.

00:06:08.598 --> 00:06:13.202
My name is Carla Maretti, said the woman.

00:06:13.261 --> 00:06:15.714
And I have a room.

00:06:15.773 --> 00:06:19.246
Dino looked up from his computer.

00:06:19.306 --> 00:06:25.260
The woman was talking to Beppo, the other young man who worked at the reception.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:30.026
Dino saw a beautiful woman with brown eyes.

00:06:30.086 --> 00:06:33.782
She smiled and looked into Dino's eyes.

00:06:33.842 --> 00:06:38.576
He looked down quickly, but it was too late.

00:06:38.636 --> 00:06:42.810
The woman left the reception to go to her room.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:45.403
Again, Dino looked up.

00:06:45.462 --> 00:06:50.946
The woman was very slim, and she wore a beautiful blue jacket.

00:06:51.006 --> 00:06:57.472
It was the colour of the sky in spring, and it looked very expensive.

00:06:57.532 --> 00:07:00.121
Do you like her?

00:07:00.181 --> 00:07:03.309
asked Beppo, laughing.

00:07:03.369 --> 00:07:07.060
Dino looked down again quickly.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.561
No, I, er, I'm just trying to finish this.

00:07:12.621 --> 00:07:17.132
Beppo laughed again and went into the kitchen.

00:07:17.192 --> 00:07:20.964
That evening, Dino was in reception.

00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:25.084
At about 11.30, he heard the telephone.

00:07:25.144 --> 00:07:27.535
He looked at the room lights.

00:07:27.595 --> 00:07:30.237
It was room 216.

00:07:30.296 --> 00:07:33.708
Carla Maretti's room.

00:07:33.768 --> 00:07:36.030
He answered the phone.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.234
Reception, can I help you, madam?

00:07:39.294 --> 00:07:43.096
Yes, said the beautiful voice.

00:07:43.156 --> 00:07:48.611
I want a sandwich, but room service is not replying.

00:07:48.671 --> 00:07:52.254
I can help you madam, said Dino.

00:07:52.314 --> 00:07:57.743
Dino phoned room service and asked them to phone room 216.

00:07:57.803 --> 00:08:05.242
About forty-five minutes later, the woman in room 216 phoned reception again.

00:08:05.302 --> 00:08:10.335
I just want to say thank you, said Carla Maretti.

00:08:10.394 --> 00:08:14.958
And you have a very nice voice.

00:08:15.018 --> 00:08:18.270
Dino's face went red.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.091
They talked for a minute or two.

00:08:21.151 --> 00:08:24.863
She lived in Rome, but she loved Venice.

00:08:24.923 --> 00:08:27.926
He told her that his name was Dino.

00:08:27.986 --> 00:08:29.437
They laughed.

00:08:29.497 --> 00:08:32.398
He thought she was very nice.

00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:38.210
The next day, Dino thought about Carla Maretti all the time.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:43.011
At about 4.30 in the afternoon, she came into the hotel.

00:08:43.072 --> 00:08:46.933
She had lots of bags from expensive shops.

00:08:46.993 --> 00:08:50.474
She looked tired after her day of shopping.

00:08:50.534 --> 00:08:54.665
She went into the cafe just across from the reception.

00:08:54.725 --> 00:09:01.566
Dino walked quickly into the cafe, Carla Maretti asked for a coffee.

00:09:01.626 --> 00:09:08.650
Dino walked up to the young waiter, took the coffee and said, can I take that?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.703
The waiter smiled at Dino.

00:09:11.763 --> 00:09:15.566
Your coffee, madam, said Dino.

00:09:15.626 --> 00:09:19.849
He put the small cup of coffee in front of Carla Maretti.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.680
She looked up.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:27.368
It's the man with the beautiful voice, Dino, she said.

00:09:27.428 --> 00:09:32.022
She looked at him, and he looked into her brown eyes.

00:09:32.082 --> 00:09:36.704
Er, your coffee, madam, he smiled.

00:09:36.764 --> 00:09:41.065
He turned to go, but she took his arm.

00:09:41.126 --> 00:09:46.698
She pulled him to her until his ear was near her mouth.

00:09:46.758 --> 00:09:51.992
This evening, at about 10.30, she said.

00:09:52.052 --> 00:09:55.724
I'm going to order drinks in my room.

00:09:55.784 --> 00:09:57.645
Please bring them.

00:09:57.705 --> 00:10:00.115
Do you understand?"

00:10:00.175 --> 00:10:02.966
Dino went red.

00:10:03.026 --> 00:10:04.746
Uhh, I...

00:10:04.806 --> 00:10:06.636
Well, yes, madam.

00:10:06.696 --> 00:10:08.146
He said.

00:10:08.206 --> 00:10:09.957
Very good.

00:10:10.017 --> 00:10:11.437
She said.

00:10:11.497 --> 00:10:17.858
She picked up the Corriere della Sera newspaper and started to read it.

00:10:17.918 --> 00:10:21.960
Dino went back to the reception and waited.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.562
He phoned room service.

00:10:24.622 --> 00:10:33.281
When Room 216 orders drinks, he said, I want to take them to Carla Maretti’s room.

00:10:33.341 --> 00:10:36.614
Time went very slowly.

00:10:36.674 --> 00:10:41.330
Then, at about 10.30, Room Service phoned.

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:46.072
Dino took Carla Maretti's drinks to her room.

00:10:46.132 --> 00:10:52.876
Ah, the man with the beautiful voice, she said, when she opened the door.

00:10:52.936 --> 00:10:57.200
Come in, I want to talk to you.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.861
Carla drank whiskey.

00:10:59.921 --> 00:11:04.094
Dino drank water because he was still at work.

00:11:04.154 --> 00:11:11.369
Sit down here, said Carla, and tell me everything about yourself.

00:11:11.429 --> 00:11:17.310
Dino never told anyone about his plans, but he told Carla.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:22.540
He talked to her about his plan to marry when he was 26.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:30.706
And then, when I'm 30 years old, I want my own hotel, with my name over the door, he said.

00:11:30.766 --> 00:11:34.618
I want it more than anything in the world.

00:11:34.678 --> 00:11:36.800
Carla listened.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:40.092
Her eyes didn't leave Dino's face.

00:11:40.152 --> 00:11:42.063
His face was red.

00:11:42.123 --> 00:11:43.945
He felt hot.

00:11:44.004 --> 00:11:48.616
Hotel Casanova, he finished.

00:11:48.676 --> 00:11:52.608
How wonderful, she said.

00:11:52.668 --> 00:11:55.489
Hotel Casanova.

00:11:55.549 --> 00:12:01.992
What a beautiful plan, and you are very nice.

00:12:02.052 --> 00:12:07.435
She put her hand on his hot face and pulled him towards her.

00:12:07.495 --> 00:12:09.536
She kissed him.

00:12:09.596 --> 00:12:11.808
He kissed her.

00:12:11.868 --> 00:12:19.940
Dino kissed girls back home in Rachella, but their kisses weren't like Carla's kisses.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.612
That night, Dino didn't sleep in his little room.

00:12:24.672 --> 00:12:29.224
He slept with Carla Maretti in room 216.

00:12:29.284 --> 00:12:33.948
At five o'clock in the morning, Dino opened his eyes.

00:12:34.008 --> 00:12:36.768
Oh no, he thought.

00:12:36.829 --> 00:12:38.350
I'm in love.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.640
I'm not 26.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:44.093
I'm just 21 years old, and I'm in love.